# Agreement Period

This scope computes the total duration of the concerted action projects as defined by the agreement.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementPeriod:
  input start_date content date
  input end_date content date
  output duration_length content duration
```

## Agreement Duration

The agreement period runs from the start date to the end date.

```catala
scope AgreementPeriod:
  date round down
  definition duration_length equals end_date - start_date
```